  message: "DONE (2026-07-20). The corrective per-language pass resolved NOT as the originally-filed per-analyzer untyped-receiver-emit gate, but as a single language-agnostic FINALIZE-STAGE demotion (chokepoint, not a 14-analyzer sweep) + producer-side qualified-marking, per the owner's 'clean gates + refined-criterion flip' ruling. Ground-truth re-measurement corrected BOTH prior framings: cont.9's 'gate the untyped-receiver funnel' (the funnel is real but the harmful subset is narrow) AND cont.10's 'measurement artifact, defer' (there IS a genuine harmful class — production->test-helper + stdlib-interface shadows — separable from the correct-but-unprovable trait residual by robust signals: broad paths.is_test_file for test-helper, PascalCase stdlib-interface names which case-separate from snake_case Rust trait methods). Shipped: PR #762 (detector route-honesty) + #763 (Rust Type::method receiver=qualified, -247 FP) + #765 (finalize sub-step 6c demotion) + #766 (durable spec_validator gate). Validated 0 harmful surviving across 11 languages incl. all 5 named here (csharp/php/cpp/objc/lua: grpc/koel/bento4/AFNetworking/vernemq). INV-fahub flipped satisfied. The scattered correct-but-unprovable trait-dispatch residual (Rust x.next 666, etc.) stays ADR-0012 scope by owner ruling."  # 04cd
